      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجُلٌ عَيْثَانُ</span></b>  <i>A man who acts corruptly;</i> or <i>who
makes,</i> or <i>does, mischief:</i> [or rather, <i>who does so
much,</i> or <i>often:</i>] fem., applied to a woman, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْثَى</span>.
